{"name": "Chop Chop Inc.", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Cut, Process, Craft, Distribute</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"438\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369130/extras/0f948e276bdf13b989ca66bc4475e203.poster.avif?t=1786432849\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369130/extras/0f948e276bdf13b989ca66bc4475e203.webm?t=1786432849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369130/extras/0f948e276bdf13b989ca66bc4475e203.mp4?t=1786432849\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><strong>You got fired from Furnox Corp \ud83d\udd95.</strong><br/><strong> Now you start over with nothing but an axe, a few trees and revenge on your mind </strong>(\u256f\u2035\u25a1\u2032)\u256f\ufe35\u253b\u2501\u253b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Chop down trees, turn logs into planks, craft furniture and sell it for profit. Reinvest your money into better tools, new machines and faster production. What begins as manual labor grows into optimized production lines and high value furniture sets that grant bonus payouts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock new areas, discover new tree types, expand your operation step by step and improve your character with strength and stamina upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"1\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369130/extras/3bdfbbe4ca7751f84572cc200bfa711c.webp?t=1786432849\" width=\"616\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83c\udf33 Cut down trees</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369130/extras/48df05aa3a31f5f169001a99e6676444.poster.avif?t=1786432849\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369130/extras/48df05aa3a31f5f169001a99e6676444.webm?t=1786432849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369130/extras/48df05aa3a31f5f169001a99e6676444.mp4?t=1786432849\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Trees of all shapes, sizes, colors and questionable physics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If it stands upright and looks even remotely choppable, congratulations: It\u2019s firewood now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"1\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369130/extras/3bdfbbe4ca7751f84572cc200bfa711c.webp?t=1786432849\" width=\"616\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83e\udeb5  Collect &amp; process resources</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369130/extras/a4a9851b42877fa18dea762844cfa4b6.poster.avif?t=1786432849\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369130/extras/a4a9851b42877fa18dea762844cfa4b6.webm?t=1786432849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369130/extras/a4a9851b42877fa18dea762844cfa4b6.mp4?t=1786432849\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Turn raw nature into refined building materials using machines that absolutely should not be left unattended.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Logs become planks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Planks become furniture.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Furniture becomes profit.\u00a0\ud83d\udcb0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"1\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369130/extras/3bdfbbe4ca7751f84572cc200bfa711c.webp?t=1786432849\" width=\"616\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udd28 Craft like a maniac</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369130/extras/594083c02041f7769ce9446e96593332.poster.avif?t=1786432849\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369130/extras/594083c02041f7769ce9446e96593332.webm?t=1786432849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369130/extras/594083c02041f7769ce9446e96593332.mp4?t=1786432849\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span>Create furniture, props and tools, including deeply unnecessary but deeply impressive designs like:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A wooden PC (Wood has excellent thermal properties... right?)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A wooden weight bench (Splinters only make you stronger!)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If it exists ... you can probably make it out of wood!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"1\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369130/extras/3bdfbbe4ca7751f84572cc200bfa711c.webp?t=1786432849\" width=\"616\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\ude9a Distribute</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369130/extras/3d08971f852519ac38a63dbaf67dac03.poster.avif?t=1786432849\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369130/extras/3d08971f852519ac38a63dbaf67dac03.webm?t=1786432849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369130/extras/3d08971f852519ac38a63dbaf67dac03.mp4?t=1786432849\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Load up your handcrafted chaos and ship it to the nearby city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earn money.<br/>Reach new customers.<br/>Confuse absolutely everyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"1\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369130/extras/3bdfbbe4ca7751f84572cc200bfa711c.webp?t=1786432849\" width=\"616\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\uded2 Buy components</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369130/extras/e27cf61fbbea83fb95fe9a9104fc2dd8.poster.avif?t=1786432849\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369130/extras/e27cf61fbbea83fb95fe9a9104fc2dd8.webm?t=1786432849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369130/extras/e27cf61fbbea83fb95fe9a9104fc2dd8.mp4?t=1786432849\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can't chop it? Can\u2019t craft it?<br/>Buy it!<br/>Use bought components to level up your character or jam them into your creations like a true artisan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"1\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369130/extras/3bdfbbe4ca7751f84572cc200bfa711c.webp?t=1786432849\" width=\"616\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udf31\u00a0<strong>Start your business!</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369130/extras/96b5a19a662995ee5c08498b09240a42.poster.avif?t=1786432849\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369130/extras/96b5a19a662995ee5c08498b09240a42.webm?t=1786432849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369130/extras/96b5a19a662995ee5c08498b09240a42.mp4?t=1786432849\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Begin with nothing but ambition and poor financial decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build your headquarters and expand into a world packed with secrets, resources and questionable business ethics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"1\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369130/extras/3bdfbbe4ca7751f84572cc200bfa711c.webp?t=1786432849\" width=\"616\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83e\udd86 Meet wacky characters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"878\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369130/extras/fcd92b9f0737cefd60dda2d06702d26f.avif?t=1786432849\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet quirky personalities, help them, befriend them and integrate them into your production chain <br/>... completely voluntarily, of course ...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u26a0\ufe0f Warning:<br/>The ducks are up to something!\u00a0<strong>\ud83e\udd86</strong><br/>They know ...<br/>You know they know ...\ud83d\udd2a</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"1\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369130/extras/3bdfbbe4ca7751f84572cc200bfa711c.webp?t=1786432849\" width=\"616\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83e\ude91 Master furniture crafting</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"878\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369130/extras/e4fc7eda0fbee52403e2a4ae9bc3dda3.avif?t=1786432849\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build an ever-growing catalog of furniture using blueprints, rare materials and raw creative chaos. <br/>Minimalism is optional. Overengineering is encouraged.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"1\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369130/extras/3bdfbbe4ca7751f84572cc200bfa711c.webp?t=1786432849\" width=\"616\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83c\udfd7\ufe0f Leave a mark</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369130/extras/f1c7e05e1c751a73535f71a04bcb67c0.poster.avif?t=1786432849\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369130/extras/f1c7e05e1c751a73535f71a04bcb67c0.webm?t=1786432849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369130/extras/f1c7e05e1c751a73535f71a04bcb67c0.mp4?t=1786432849\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade the nearby city to unlock new customers, missions, secrets, and character upgrades.<br/>Urban development has never involved this much ... wood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"1\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369130/extras/3bdfbbe4ca7751f84572cc200bfa711c.webp?t=1786432849\" width=\"616\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udc8e Unique trees</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"878\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369130/extras/a6819e3a7a4a95373d6e08da96fae405.avif?t=1786432849\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stone trees</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Metal trees</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Electric trees</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Nobody knows why they exist. <br/>Your axe doesn\u2019t care.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Uncover their mysterious origins as you progress ... or just chop first and ask questions later.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"1\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369130/extras/3bdfbbe4ca7751f84572cc200bfa711c.webp?t=1786432849\" width=\"616\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udcaa Character stats</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"878\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369130/extras/b2bb0a7c3c4023c03df5f7a9f59f3981.avif?t=1786432849\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Improve your character by interacting with the world and using exercise equipment.<br/>Yes, you can bench press your way to better woodworking.<br/>No, we will not explain the science.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"1\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369130/extras/3bdfbbe4ca7751f84572cc200bfa711c.webp?t=1786432849\" width=\"616\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u2699\ufe0f Powerful upgrades</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"878\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369130/extras/bf5278e7bdc7c94ea1b1235d3277e377.avif?t=1786432849\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New machines.<br/>Better axes.<br/>\"Smarter\" distribution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Automation that makes your empire run smoother than a freshly sanded plank.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"1\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369130/extras/3bdfbbe4ca7751f84572cc200bfa711c.webp?t=1786432849\" width=\"616\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83c\udf72 Cooking</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"878\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369130/extras/53593eb70688aa1402c43f17d1a3a379.avif?t=1786432849\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Turn resources into delicious meals that boost your stats.<br/>Because nothing fuels industrial-scale lumber destruction like a hearty stew.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"1\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369130/extras/3bdfbbe4ca7751f84572cc200bfa711c.webp?t=1786432849\" width=\"616\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Build your own furniture empire after getting fired from Furnox Corp \ud83d\udd95. Chop down trees, process wood, automate your growing production lines and sell clever furniture sets for bonus cash. Explore a handcrafted world packed with weirdos, secrets and trees begging for violence.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369130/8bceabf2e3a7a845696baf18c09b377684d116ae/header.jpg?t=1786432849", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Job Simulator", "Crafting", "Comedy", "First-Person", "Relaxing", "Exploration"], "developers": "NullRef Entertainment", "publishers": "NullRef Entertainment", "release_date": "Aug 7, 2026", "price": "$12.99", "appid": "4369130", "review_type": "Recommended", "curator_desc": "21 May 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/5qpmNXTqudY", "first_seen": 1779314400.0, "review_rank": 469}